Need to check evaluation of kNuisBANFFPDDDoubleCount splines is correct. NuXSec::SystWght_1p() and FinTuningWght_1p()

--
There are lots 4 macros like: macros/fit/toymc/test_n_mock_data_fits*.C, corresponding to:
 read toy MC from file / generate on the fly
 save systematic tweaks & best fits / not
The _with_sys macros should be removed, and the remaining macros should save:
 the best fit values of all parameters
 the fit errors of all parameters
 and the on-the-fly macro should also save the tweak values of all parameters

macros/fit/pulls/mock_data_fit_pulls.C also requires a major rewrite after this change

__
macros/contour/fc/numu/feldman_cousins_fitting_job.C should save tweak value, best fit, and error of all systematics

__
macros/spectra/test_sk_ereco_spectrum_twk_sys_throw.C should save tweak value of all systematics


